---
import TechStack from "../components/TechStack.astro";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About - Shedrack Akintayo">
    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-16 sm:py-24">
        <header class="mb-12 md:mb-20">
          <h1 class="text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-7xl"><span class="text-primary">/</span>About</h1>
        </header>
        <div class="grid gap-16 md:grid-cols-[1fr_300px] lg:grid-cols-[1fr_380px] items-start">
            <div class="order-first md:order-last">
                <figure class="relative group md:sticky md:top-32">
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 -rotate-2 rounded-2xl bg-neutral-200 dark:bg-neutral-800 transition-transform duration-500 ease-out group-hover:-rotate-1"></div>
                    <div class="relative rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-neutral-950 p-2 ring-1 ring-neutral-200 dark:ring-neutral-800 shadow-sm transition-transform duration-500 ease-out group-hover:-translate-y-1">
                        <img
                            src="/me.jpg"
                            alt="Shedrack Akintayo"
                            class="w-full h-auto rounded-xl object-cover transition-[filter] duration-500 grayscale-[0.15] group-hover:grayscale-0"
                        />
                    </div>
                </figure>
            </div>

            <section class="prose prose-neutral dark:prose-invert prose-headings:font-medium prose-h2:text-2xl prose-h3:text-lg prose-p:leading-relaxed prose-a:underline-offset-4 hover:prose-a:text-neutral-600 dark:hover:prose-a:text-neutral-300 max-w-none">
                <p class="text-xl text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed mb-12">
                    I work at the intersection of developer experience, cloud-native
                    systems, and AI context architecture. Across more than eight years
                    in software engineering, DevRel, and technical writing, I have
                    built the documentation, tools, and knowledge systems that help
                    developers and coding agents understand complex products and act
                    with confidence.
                </p>

                <h2>What I Do</h2>

                <h3>Context Architecture & AI Engineering</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        Built <a
                            href="https://kontinuo.dev"
                            target="_blank"
                            rel="noopener noreferrer">Kontinuo</a
                        >, a local-first MCP server and CLI for verifiable handoffs
                        between AI coding agents
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Designed Kontinuo schema-backed checkpoint model to combine explicit
                        session intent with Git and workspace evidence, including
                        provenance, freshness, and drift checks
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Led Traefik's agentic-docs initiative, restructuring product
                        documentation into a high-fidelity, machine-readable context
                        layer for RAG and AI coding assistants
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Built internal Claude tooling that generates codebase
                        documentation from implementation pull requests
                    </li>
                </ul>

                <h3>Technical Writing & Documentation Architecture</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        Design and maintain documentation systems for cloud-native
                        products and open-source communities
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Create product documentation, tutorials, release notes, and
                        enterprise case studies for technical audiences
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Validate product behavior through source code, API, Kubernetes,
                        and configuration reviews before documenting it
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Build docs-as-code workflows that improve onboarding, adoption,
                        and machine retrieval
                    </li>
                </ul>

                <h3>Developer Relations & Cloud-Native Experience</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        Started and scaled the Cloud Foundry Foundation's global DevRel
                        program for a community of more than 14,000 developers
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Produced technical content for developer publications, product
                        blogs, and communities serving audiences in the millions
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Built education and adoption programs across Platform.sh,
                        Isovalent/Cisco, and other developer-focused companies
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Work hands-on with Kubernetes, Go, Docker, Terraform,
                        eBPF/Cilium, and CI/CD to explain real product behavior
                    </li>
                </ul>

                <h2>Tech Stack</h2>
                <div class="not-prose my-8 rounded-2xl bg-neutral-50 dark:bg-neutral-800/30 p-6 sm:p-8 ring-1 ring-neutral-100 dark:ring-neutral-800/50">
                    <TechStack />
                </div>

                <h2>Beyond the Screen</h2>
                <p>
                    When I'm not architecting cloud systems or writing
                    documentation, I'm a dedicated athlete. I cross-train in
                    strength, Muay Thai, running, and football. I believe the
                    discipline and resilience built in sports directly translate
                    to engineering excellence.
                </p>

                <h2>Let's Connect</h2>
                <p>
                    I'm always interested in discussing context architecture for AI
                    coding agents, MCP integrations and agentic documentation,
                    documentation strategy for complex products, and cloud-native
                    developer experience.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Feel free to reach out through <a
                        href="https://linkedin.com/in/shedrackakintayo"
                        >LinkedIn</a
                    > or check out my <a
                        target="_blank"
                        href="https://sheddy.work">projects</a
                    >.
                </p>
            </section>
        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>
